category: Libs
build-depends: cygport jq libmtbl-devel libwdns-devel mtbl
sdesc: "Encoding format, library, and utilities for passive DNS data (utilities)"
ldesc: "dnstable implements an encoding format for passive DNS data. It consists of a
C library, libdnstable, and several command line utilities for creating,
querying, and merging dnstable data files."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/farsightsec/dnstable
